@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 225
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 90
hide circle
hide empty members
package "正式结算、原单撤销及实际结算款" as S {
' @reference insurance_case
class "医保就诊办理" as case_s <<entity>>
' @reference fee_request
class "费用申请" as request_s <<entity>>
class "医保结算" as insurance_settlement <<entity>> {
 正式结算号、范围内总费T
 基金F、个账A、其他自付P
 有效／已撤销、实际确认时间
 /应拨额、/净到账、/待收或待退
 --
 +核对明确正式结果及分摊()
 +确认有效正式结算()
 +按成功撤销停用原结算()
 +计算应拨及收退差额(实际收付)
}
class "医保撤销办理" as insurance_reversal <<entity>> {
 唯一撤销号、原因及负责人依据
 待办理／待核实／已成功／已失败
 原笔结果、核实人及时间
 --
 +核对原结算及批准依据()
 +建立原单撤销待办()
 +保留未知或失败结果(真实依据)
 +确认平台撤销成功()
}
class "医保结算款收付" as insurance_fund_receipt <<entity>> {
 拨付或退回、实际正金额
 实际时间、医保或银行凭据
 经办人员
 --
 +核对原结算及实际收付依据()
 +核对重复收付(原单及凭据)
 +记录实际拨付或退回()
}
case_s "1" -- "0..*" insurance_settlement
insurance_settlement "1" -- "0..*" insurance_reversal
request_s "0..1" -- "0..*" insurance_reversal
insurance_settlement "1" -- "0..*" insurance_fund_receipt
insurance_reversal -[hidden]right- insurance_fund_receipt
note bottom of insurance_settlement
T＝F＋A＋P，均非负；正式结果与预估分开保存。
同一费用不重复有效结算；未知或未决先查原号。
撤销成功才改变原结算，患者退款另按UC-14。
有效结算应拨＝F＋A，已撤销应拨＝0；
净到账＝实际拨付－实际退回，差额＝应拨－净到账。
差额正为待收、负为待退，不能自动转成患者欠费。
end note
}
@enduml
